// juniper_mx10004's show route instance detail named VRF interfaces on a
// ge-0/0/0 port the profile does not have. The junos-chassis model gained the
// VRF units xe-0/0/0.100, .200 and .999 beside unit 0, at ifIndex 74-76, and
// the VRF view now names them. This change added their ifTable and ifXTable
// rows and raised ifNumber from 73 to 76. Those rows were machine-generated by
// diffing the generated chassis part at the parent revision against this
// change and are committed verbatim. Every added OID name is already served by
// another profile, and no value changed its tag, so the name view moves
// nothing.

